# Test Reports Directory

This directory stores test execution reports and logs.

## File Types

- `*.log` - Raw test execution logs
- `*.json` - Structured test results
- `*.html` - HTML test reports

## Structure

```
reports/
  ├── 2025-05-06-run-001.log
  ├── 2025-05-06-run-001.json
  └── summary.md
```

Generated automatically by CI/CD and local scripts.
